WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,260
Su Wanwan

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,080
It has always been the number one project followed by Wu Xun

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:08,660
But Wu Xun did not report on the progress of the project

4
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,540
So according to your understanding

5
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:13,980
How much do you know about the leader No. 1?

6
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,900
That's a murderous man

7
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:23,540
Killed my service captain again

8
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,260
I don’t know much about No. 1’s situation.

9
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,900
Basically looking for opportunities to chat with me

10
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,460
According to reports from on-site members

11
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:31,060
This mourner can communicate

12
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,660
Didn't he say anything to you?

13
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,540
He also mentioned personal grudges

14
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,340
Does it refer to the matter between you and him?

15
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:38,460
That mourner used to wander around my house

16
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:40,100
Acted very ordinary at first

17
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,780
After my boyfriend caught him breaking into our home.

18
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,060
Throw him out directly
